{"id": "ev-lane3-sipri", "url": "https://www.sipri.org/publications/2025/sipri-fact-sheets/trends-world-military-expenditure-2024", "date": "2025-04-28", "coverage": "2015—2024军费实际历史估计", "excerpt": "SIPRI估计日本2024军费553亿美元，比2023实际增21%、比2015实际增49%；美国2024军费9970亿美元，中国3140亿美元。日本军费占GDP1.4%，并支出于远程打击与防空能力。", "limitation": "军费是军事投入而非综合军事实力或政治大国地位；部分为开放资料估计。2027计划不计作实际实现。", "local_archive": "data/sources/lane3-sipri.html", "sha256": "4d9d13d6b602f43b5c53ddac313f6496ddf5f105dd77cd9e5b56f205a66bebd7", "verified": true, "archive_type": "publisher_html", "retrieved_on": "2026-11-09"}
